# Ctrl+Break (Ctrl+Scroll Lock) while the program waits for a key: the
# keyboard driver signals the OS server, which restarts the program and
# gives up the wait; keys go on working (roadmap l4.md L8).
program: keys
keys: {ctrl-break}a
---
rx286, test build
rx286: Ctrl+Break: the program starts again
keys: started again
key 1E 61
